"NSHealthShareUsageDescription" = "If you allow it, LIBRE reads your steps, distance, exercise minutes, active energy, sleep, heart rate (resting and its variability) and respiratory rate, to show them next to your tracking. LIBRE writes nothing to Health. This data stays on your iPhone and is never sent.";
"NSFaceIDUsageDescription" = "Face ID lets you open LIBRE without typing your code. Your face is never sent to LIBRE: your iPhone checks it.";
